{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-knot-indexed-convolution-grid","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:knot-indexed-convolution-grid","kind":"proposition","title":"Placement of paper's existing knot-indexed convolutions in the bi-filtration grid","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-joint-galois-braid-action","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-vol-through-tau"],"tags":["bi-filtration","knot-indexed-convolution","placement-table","categorical-linking","EW-interface-knot","graded-mikusinski"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotIndexedConvolutionGrid.grid_placement","text":"knot-indexed-convolution-grid.md","leanSource":"knot-indexed-convolution-grid.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:knot-indexed-convolution-grid\"></a><p><em>Each operational non-tensor product linking two morphisms in the QOU occupies a specific <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(n, K)</code> stratum in the bi-filtration grid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n, K)}</code>.</em></p>\n<p>The grid structure and its role in separating input shape from output\ntranscendence depth are described in\n<a href=\"#rem:knot-indexed-convolution-grid-context\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mutant-jones-bloch-group\">the convolution-grid context</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/knot-indexed-convolution-grid.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.17.1","page":"b/prop-knot-indexed-convolution-grid","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.KnotIndexedConvolutionGrid.placement_depth","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-un